{"noun":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/f4/cd/153067_crt_9O4Rw.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/f4/cd/153067_crt_9O4Rw.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/f4/cd/153067_crt_9O4Rw.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/f4/cd/153067_crt_9O4Rw.jpg"},"name":"桃夭","summary":"桃都灵医，专给妖怪治病，在妖怪之间留下了\"灵医桃夭，善恶如谜。金铃过处，片甲不留\"的传闻。在桃都为百妖谱的看守者，百妖谱丢失后为了避免被桃都之主责罚，离开桃都，与磨牙、柳公子一路寻找百妖谱的踪迹。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/84/5f/38698_prsn_mwWMw.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/84/5f/38698_prsn_mwWMw.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/84/5f/38698_prsn_mwWMw.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/84/5f/38698_prsn_mwWMw.jpg"},"name":"赵双","short_summary":"中国女性声优，北斗企鹅工作室成员，擅长扮演擅长古灵精怪的角色。","career":["seiyu"],"id":38698,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":153067},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/d4/39/153068_crt_j7YYg.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/d4/39/153068_crt_j7YYg.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/d4/39/153068_crt_j7YYg.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/d4/39/153068_crt_j7YYg.jpg"},"name":"柳公子","summary":"生活在桃都的蛇妖，桃夭的邻居。力量强大，是其他妖怪都畏惧的大蛇妖。想吃掉桃夭从金佛寺救出的和尚磨牙，为此与桃夭协定为桃夭做一百件事后将磨牙吃掉。目前与桃夭、磨牙一起云游，充当\"保镖\"。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/79/b3/29653_prsn_SgQ6J.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/79/b3/29653_prsn_SgQ6J.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/79/b3/29653_prsn_SgQ6J.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/79/b3/29653_prsn_SgQ6J.jpg"},"name":"夏侯落枫","short_summary":"夏侯落枫是中国大陆的声优，北斗企鹅工作室所属。","career":["seiyu"],"id":29653,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":153068},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/f4/15/153069_crt_Lo8WV.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/f4/15/153069_crt_Lo8WV.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/f4/15/153069_crt_Lo8WV.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/f4/15/153069_crt_Lo8WV.jpg"},"name":"磨牙","summary":"桃天身边的小和尚，慈悲为怀，以拯救苍生为己任。从小在金佛寺长大，金佛寺遭遇变故后被桃夭救出，与其一起生活在桃都，身体不再长大。百妖谱丢失后，离开桃都与桃夭、柳公子一起云游。","relation":"主角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/71/32/35812_prsn_velP2.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/71/32/35812_prsn_velP2.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/71/32/35812_prsn_velP2.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/71/32/35812_prsn_velP2.jpg"},"name":"常蓉珊","short_summary":"配音演员常蓉珊，2017年，加入北斗企鹅工作室；2022年，加入藤韵文化。","career":["seiyu"],"id":35812,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":153069},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/8b/66/153079_crt_hS838.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/8b/66/153079_crt_hS838.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/8b/66/153079_crt_hS838.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/8b/66/153079_crt_hS838.jpg"},"name":"司狂澜","summary":"司府的二少爷，外界传闻中司府的\"活阎王\"之一。司狂澜外貌俊美，气场清冷，寡言却可靠。他热爱阅读，精通音律，经常在司府妄园中看书。相比和人之间的关系，司狂澜更喜欢马。表面上司狂澜是个高高在上不食人间烟火的少爷，但其实他也有接地气的一面。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/07/31/18116_prsn_tqZNi.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/07/31/18116_prsn_tqZNi.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/07/31/18116_prsn_tqZNi.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/07/31/18116_prsn_tqZNi.jpg"},"name":"藤新","short_summary":"配音演员、导演，毕业于四川音乐学院，2008年进入北京配音圈。担任Discovery探索频道配音导演和演员，是VOASIA、怀旧配音联盟 、声创联盟等网络配音社团成员。2020年12月，成立藤新工作室（现已改名藤韵文化）并参加《我是特优声》节目。曾联合创立北斗企鹅工作室，于2022年1月退出。\r\n\r\n艺名“藤新”源于《名侦探柯南》的主角[url=https://bgm.tv/character/3455]工藤新一[/url]。","career":["seiyu"],"id":18116,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":153079},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/e2/d5/153080_crt_Z4H6h.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/e2/d5/153080_crt_Z4H6h.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/e2/d5/153080_crt_Z4H6h.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/e2/d5/153080_crt_Z4H6h.jpg"},"name":"司静渊","summary":"京城司府的大少爷，司狂澜的哥哥。性格活泼外向，话很多，没有什么大少爷架子非常宠爱弟弟司狂澜。拥有\"换魂\"的能力，但魂魄离体后可被没有实体的妖怪进入其躯体。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/c6/a4/9145_prsn_9WY7O.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/c6/a4/9145_prsn_9WY7O.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/c6/a4/9145_prsn_9WY7O.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/c6/a4/9145_prsn_9WY7O.jpg"},"name":"皇贞季","short_summary":"声创联盟社长，声创联盟中文配音社团（以下简称：声创联盟）成立于2005年2月15日，是由互联网自发组织的“声优之翼网络社团”、“声创世纪网络社团”、“混沌之尘网络社团”三大网络中文配音社团合并而成。目前参与配音爱好者成员60人以上。社团主要从事动画、真人剧等视频，以及广播剧的配音制作。\r\n2012年9月联合山新、藤新、Slayerboom共同创立企鹅工作室。\r\n2016年5月20日，山新在微博发表自己已与皇贞季结婚[https://weibo.com/ttarticle/p/show?id=2309403977214197685881]。","career":["seiyu"],"id":9145,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":153080},{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/dc/be/153082_crt_uz2aZ.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/dc/be/153082_crt_uz2aZ.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/dc/be/153082_crt_uz2aZ.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/dc/be/153082_crt_uz2aZ.jpg"},"name":"苗管家","summary":"司府的大管家。与陆澄、晓镜是同乡，三人有过一段快乐的年少时光，却因战乱而分离。为报国仇家恨拜师于司父，成为了司府的大管家。后与陆澄相逢，并在清扫拐卖者的行动中意外救下晓镜，三人得以相聚。","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/85/32/31978_prsn_DDCY8.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/85/32/31978_prsn_DDCY8.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/85/32/31978_prsn_DDCY8.jpg","medium":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/400/pic/crt/l/85/32/31978_prsn_DDCY8.jpg"},"name":"刘琮","short_summary":"刘琮，男性配音演员，北京人。丽音留香配音培训班第二期学员，2017年，加入729声工场。","career":["seiyu"],"id":31978,"type":1,"locked":false}],"type":1,"id":153082},{"images":{"small":"","grid":"","large":"","medium":""},"name":"少年","summary":"","relation":"配角","actors":[{"images":{"small":"https://lain.bgm.tv/r/100/pic/crt/l/64/ef/77447_prsn_4cmm4.jpg","grid":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/g/64/ef/77447_prsn_4cmm4.jpg","large":"https://lain.bgm.tv/pic/crt/l/64/ef/77447_prsn_4cmm4.jpg"